    "title": "If TDF stopped, guideline-recommended alternative is ABC+3TC+DTG",
    "message": "Guidelines state that if renal impairment develops due to TDF, the recommended alternative regimen is ABC + 3TC + DTG. If the clinician decides to permanently discontinue TDF after this AKI episode, this specific switch should be used. However, given the pre-renal presentation, temporary TDF continuation with close monitoring during recovery may be more appropriate than permanent discontinuation.",
